And not just that, we will also cover

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:10.160
how to communicate as a developer,

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:12.560
which will also translate into leadership skills

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:14.340
and how to give and receive feedback

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.360
as a developer and a leader.

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.400
So I really hope you enjoy this course.

